{"title":"Center for Talented Youth","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Center for Talented Youth</b> (CTY) at Johns Hopkins University is a program which offers resources  for top students in grades two through eight.\n</p><p>The programs offered by CTY are:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Talent Search</li>\n<li>Summer academic programs</li>\n<li>Distance education</li>\n<li>Family academic conferences</li>\n<li>Diagnostic and counselling centre</li>\n<li>Study of exceptional talent (SET)</li>\n<li>Research</li></ul>\n<p>In this summer program, you will choose a course to learn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Summer_program\">Summer program</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Summer program\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The CTY has a summer program that operates either online, or on college campuses. Some courses require prior tests to enroll. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://cty.jhu.edu/\">CTY Website</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018075459\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\n